{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Tracking","generated":true,"anchor":"Tracking","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-7fax9","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-24yuc"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and queues"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catch up; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the records."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the waits of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","type":"reference"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"track","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process exits. A tracker given a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Tracker","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L52"}},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"]},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/fl